        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dun Mhuire, Carrignafoy Avenue, Cobh, Co. Cork P24D544 \r\n\r\nKW Quigg are delighted to being to the market an exceptional Detached Bungalow in One of Cobh's Most Sought-After Residential Locations \r\n\r\nDun Mhuire is a beautifully presented detached three-bedroom bungalow set on mature private gardens in the highly desirable Carrignafoy area of Cobh. Combining privacy, convenience and modern upgrades, this superb home offers an outstanding opportunity for families, downsizers and anyone seeking a quality residence within walking distance of all local amenities. \r\n\r\nThe property's location is truly exceptional. Situated directly opposite a popular walking and running track, residents can enjoy an active outdoor lifestyle from their doorstep. A local shop is located just 200 metres away, while a regular bus service can be accessed within 300 metres. The property is also within a five-minute walk of a gym, swimming pool and all of Cobh's principal primary and secondary schools, making it one of the most convenient residential settings in the town. \r\n\r\nInternally, the accommodation is bright, spacious and well-maintained throughout. The home features three generously proportioned bedrooms, a newly renovated contemporary bathroom and a newly fitted kitchen that has never been used. Two conservatories provide additional living space and offer the perfect setting to enjoy the surrounding gardens throughout the year. \r\n\r\nOutside, the mature landscaped gardens provide excellent privacy from the road, creating a peaceful and secluded environment. A substantial detached block-built garage extending to approximately 34 sq. m offers exceptional storage, workshop potential or space for a variety of hobbies and uses. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a detached home in a mature, established neighbourhood where every amenity is within easy reach. \r\n\r\nTopiary Lodge offers the perfect balance of tranquillity and convenience, all within one of Cobh's most desirable residential addresses. \r\n\r\nAccommodation \r\nKitchen 2.8 x 6.4 \r\nKitchen Conservatory 5.4 x 2.5 \r\nLiving room 3.9 x 3.8 \r\nLiving room conservatory 4.7 x 2.4 \r\nHall 9 sqm \r\nW/C 1.7 x 2.9 \r\nBedroom 1 2.5 x 2.8 \r\nBedroom 2 2.8 x 3.4 \r\nBedroom 3 3 x 3.6 \r\nDetached Garage 3.3 x 9.5 \r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\n- Detached 3-bedroom bungalow \r\n- BER Pending \r\n- Prime Carrignafoy location \r\n- Two bright conservatories \r\n- Newly fitted kitchen (unused) \r\n- Newly renovated modern bathroom \r\n- UPVC double-glazed windows throughout \r\n- New gas boiler \r\n- Detached block-built garage/workshop/apt \r\n- Mature private gardens \r\n- Excellent privacy from the road \r\n- Directly opposite walking/running track \r\n- 200m from local shop - 300m from bus stop \r\n- 5-minute walk to gym and swimming pool \r\n- Walking distance to all major schools \r\n- Convenient access to Cobh town centre and commuter services \r\n\r\nViewing By Appointment only Call Auctioneer James Quigg 083 382 0623"
      }
